{"id": "De4ha86ySW2", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "परखना मत, परखने में कोई अपना नहीं रहता 🧡\n\nDo bindu the… itne paas ki ek hi roshni mein saans lete the.\nPhir ek parakhne wali nazar aayi, aur jo apna tha woh chhota hota gaya… door hota gaya… aur ek din woh roshni hi bujh gayi.\nAaine mein uska aks bhi zyada der nahi ruka. Bade daayre ke paas jaake usne doori seekhi. Aur dariya ban ke jab woh samundar mein utra, toh apna rang hi kho baitha.\n\nAakhir mein jab woh nazar phir aayi… is baar bindu ne use khud door kar diya.\nAur laut aaya apne ke paas. Wahi roshni, wahi saans 🤍\n\n✍️ Bashir Badr · 🎙️ @chinmayitripathi \n\nKaunsa sher dil pe laga? Comment mein likho… aur us apne ko bhejo jo bina parkhe hamesha tumhara raha\n\nParakhna mat parakhne mein koi apna nahi rehta | Bashir Badr shayari | Bashir Badr ghazal | Urdu ghazal | Hindi shayari | sad shayari | ghazal animation | poetry animation | minimalist animation | animated poetry\n\n#BashirBadr #Ghazal #UrduPoetry #Shayari #MinimalistAnimation", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792858098, "like_count": 1146, "comment_count": 15, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1825860582063666a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 60.667, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPxslEwfpuzx6IX3fz0df5aocaOlNWU5ogfswca7PBoioFpOkmEcTFlYwXHjKE5vrX9yDgSJaFtDBz5dVG_8lz8zQ0_kg53BEhGxX4.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdqaQJS8TyDquUjYMG3L1kOLUasFSet339yEpXbOkU8aOYOGHtj9O4i8YmlhLUoqO-VbtZ8IuK9UjcrcKlmWYP8W&